{"title":"Fitness Smartwatches","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"terra-fit-smart-watch","title":"Terra Fit Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"599\"\u003eThe Terra Fit Smartwatch is designed for active lifestyles that demand reliability, smart connectivity, and everyday comfort. With Bluetooth calling support, health tracking essentials, and a durable sporty build, Terra Fit helps you stay connected, track your fitness, and manage daily tasks effortlessly—whether you’re working out, commuting, or unwinding.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"899\"\u003eBuilt around a practical full-touch display and powered by a single-chip Bluetooth calling system, Terra Fit delivers smooth performance with essential smart features that matter most. Its long battery life, water resistance, and fitness-focused tools make it a dependable companion for daily wear.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Rose Pink","offer_id":51181307920662,"sku":"22850","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":44679171735830,"sku":"18564","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Grey","offer_id":44679171768598,"sku":"18577","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Red Berry","offer_id":44679171703062,"sku":"18576","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":44679171834134,"sku":"18575","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Olive Green","offer_id":44679171801366,"sku":"18578","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/1_df601d00-3118-441f-ac86-ce5b8f69a31a.webp?v=1776933536"},{"product_id":"revolt-smart-watch","title":"Revoltt Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eStep into luxury with Revoltt Smart Watch: Sleek Stainless Steel, Durable Metallic Body, \u0026amp; Advanced Health Suite. Premium tech for your elite lifestyle!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eRevolt Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Revolt Smartwatch is designed for those who demand cutting-edge technology and sleek design in their wearable devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003esmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eis your ultimate tool for staying connected, tracking your health, and boosting your daily productivity. Whether you're in a meeting, at the gym, or out with friends, the Revolt Smartwatch fits effortlessly into your routine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Revolt Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Revolt Smartwatch comes with a robust set of features to keep you ahead. Track your fitness with precision using its advanced sensors for heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and various sports modes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated with smart notifications for calls, texts, and apps, all visible on a clear, high-resolution display. The long-lasting battery ensures you’re always ready for action, and with customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps, you can easily match your watch to your outfit and mood.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Revolt Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.4-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 400 x 400 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer, gyroscope\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 47 x 39 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 10 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP68 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 42g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Revolt SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing the Luna Smartwatch means embracing a device that enhances your life with its high-end features and stylish design. Its comprehensive health tracking, seamless connectivity, and customizable appearance make it a standout choice in the smartwatch market. Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures you have a smooth experience from purchase to everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gun Metal","offer_id":46539391664406,"sku":"19819","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":46539391631638,"sku":"19820","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gold","offer_id":46539391598870,"sku":"19818","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":48949103558934,"sku":"22463","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/RevoltGolden01.webp?v=1736870078"},{"product_id":"drift-smart-watch","title":"Drift Smart Watch","description":"\u003cp\u003eConquer every challenge with Drift Smart Watch: A Luxury Sport marvel with a 1.91\" Curved HD Display. Elevate your game with unmatched style and functionality!!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDrift Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAmp up your lifestyle with the Drift Smartwatch, where technology meets style. Make your routine more efficient and stylish with a smartwatch designed to keep up with your life. Order your Drift Smartwatch today and experience the perfect blend of innovation and design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis smartwatch is your ideal partner for staying connected, monitoring your health, and enhancing your daily activities. Whether you're at work, working out, or socializing, the Flex Smartwatch fits seamlessly into your lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Drift Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Drift Smartwatch is packed with features to help you stay ahead. Monitor your fitness with its advanced sensors for heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and multiple sports modes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay connected with smart notifications for calls, messages, and social media updates, all accessible on a vibrant, high-resolution display. Its long-lasting battery ensures you're always ready for action, and with customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps, you can easily match your watch to your style and needs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Flex Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.4-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 400 x 400 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer, gyroscope\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 46 x 39 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 10 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP68 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 42g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Drift SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing the Drift Smartwatch means opting for a device that enhances your life with its superior functionality and stylish design. Its comprehensive health tracking, seamless connectivity, and customizable appearance make it a standout choice in the smartwatch market. Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures a smooth experience from purchase to daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Zer