cted effortlessly with smart notifications for calls, messages, and social media updates, all accessible on a high-resolution display. The long-lasting battery ensures you’re always powered up, while customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps let you personalize your look to match any occasion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Ninja Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.4-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 360 x 360 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 45 x 38 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 10 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP68 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 40g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Ninja SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpting for the Ninja Smartwatch means choosing a device that enhances your life with its superior functionality and sleek design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts comprehensive health tracking, seamless connectivity, and stylish aesthetics make it a top choice in the smartwatch market. Plus, with dedicated customer support, you can enjoy a hassle-free experience from purchase to daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Camou Green","offer_id":46921441116438,"sku":"19635","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Camou Gray","offer_id":46921441083670,"sku":"19636","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":46921441018134,"sku":"19633","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Green","offer_id":46921441050902,"sku":"19634","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbn