 and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":47069797450006,"sku":"20081","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gray","offer_id":47069797548310,"sku":"20080","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":47069797515542,"sku":"20084","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pink Gold","offer_id":47069797482774,"sku":"20077","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":48148570308886,"sku":"20680","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Sporty Gray Rings","offer_id":48926634311958,"sku":"22477","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Sporty Red Rings","offer_id":48926630936854,"sku":"22479","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Luna-_5_3.webp?v=1776510284"},{"product_id":"nova-smart-watch","title":"Nova Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003eNova Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUpgrade your tech with the Nova Smartwatch, where innovation meets elegance. Make your daily routine more productive and stylish with a smartwatch designed to keep pace with your life. Order your Nova Smartwatch today and embrace the perfect blend of technology and fashion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Nova Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Nova Smartwatch is equipped with a range of features to keep you on track and connected. Its advanced fitness tracking includes heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and various sports modes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated with smart notifications for calls, messages, and social media alerts, all displayed on a vibrant, high-resolution screen. The long-lasting battery ensures you stay powered throughout your day, and customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps let you personalize your look.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Nova Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.3-inch TFT full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 360 x 360 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer, gyroscope\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 45 x 38 x 10 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 7 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP68 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 40g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Nova SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpting for the Nova Smartwatch means choosing a device that enhances your life with its advanced features and stylish design. Its comprehensive health tracking, seamless connectivity, and elegant appearance make it a top choice. Plus, with our dedicated customer support, you can enjoy a hassle-free experience from purchase to daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":47263090180374,"sku":"20096","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Golden","offer_id":47263090311446,"sku":"20101","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":47263090213142,"sku":"20097","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Nova Gray","offer_id":47263090344214,"sku":"20100","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":47263090245910,"sku":"20103","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Rainbow","offer_id":47263090278678,"sku":"20093","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Dark-Black.webp?v=1705740899"},{"product_id":"pixel-smartwatch","title":"Pixel Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003ePixel Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMeet the Pixel Smartwatch, the ultimate fusion of technology and style, designed to simplify and enhance your everyday life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePerfect for those who demand both functionality and elegance in their wearable tech, the Pixel Smartwatch offers a seamless user experience with its intuitive features and sophisticated design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Pixel Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Pixel Smartwatch is packed with features to help you stay on top of your health and connected to what matters most.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMonitor your fitness with advanced tracking capabilities, including heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and multiple sports modes. Stay updated with smart notifications for calls, texts, and apps, all accessible from your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay connected effortlessly with smart notifications for calls, messages, and apps right on your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts vibrant, high-resolution display ensures everything is crystal clear, while the long-lasting battery keeps you powered through your day. With customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps, you can personalize your Pixel Smartwatch to match any outfit or occasion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Pixel Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.4-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 360 x 360 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer, gyroscope\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 46 x 38 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 7 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP68 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 40g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Pixel SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing the Pixel Smartwatch means opting for a device that seamlessly integrates into your life. Its comprehensive features, high-quality build, and stylish design make it a standout choice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you're tracking your fitness, staying connected, or simply enhancing your style, the Pixel Smartwatch delivers. Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures you have a smooth experience from purchase to everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Rainbow Gold","offer_id":48544548913430,"sku":"20449","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Golden","offer_id":48543732826390,"sku":"20153","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":48543732760854,"sku":"20154","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":48543732728086,"sku":"20152","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/3_1_-1.png?v=1717406207"},{"product_id":"elite-smart-watch","title":"Elite Smartwatch","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"pin-spacer\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Elite smartwatch is a testament to innovation and style. Boasting a stunning 2.04\" AMOLED display, it delivers a visual experience like no other.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eElite Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Elite \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eZero Smartwatch\u003c\/a\u003e combines high-tech features with a stylish design. Perfect for those who want both performance and elegance, this smartwatch helps you stay connected, track your health, and improve your daily routine. Whether you're at work, the gym, or out with friends, the Elite Smartwatch fits effortlessly into your life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Elite Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Elite Smartwatch comes with a robust set of features to keep you ahead. Track your fitness with precision using its advanced sensors for heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and multiple sports modes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated with smart notifications for calls, texts, and apps, all visible on a clear, high-resolution display. The long-lasting battery ensures you’re always ready for action, and with customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps, you can easily match your watch to your outfit and mood.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Elite Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.3-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 400 x 400 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 47 x 39 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 10 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP68 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 42g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Elite SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Elite Smartwatch stands out with its powerful features and stylish design, making it the perfect choice for anyone looking to enhance their lifestyle. Its extensive health tracking, smart connectivity, and customizable design set it apart in the smartwatch market. Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures a hassle-free experience from purchase to daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Starlight","offer_id":48944557818134,"sku":"20610","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Rose Gold","offer_id":48944557785366,"sku":"20611","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":48944557850902,"sku":"20609","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Black_1.webp?v=1725950686"},{"product_id":"crown-smartwatch","title":"Crown Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eCrown Smart Watch Product Description\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience technology that’s beyond luxury with the all-new Crown Smartwatch packed with features that are never before seen in the industry with a Vegan Leather Strap that is resistant to wrinkles, sweat and tears and powered with the industry’s first True Always On Ultra AMOLED Display resting on a chrome plated dial, making the Crown a benchmark of luxury with the latest technology, all on your wrist!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"features\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Crown Smart Watch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTrue Always On Display:\u003c\/strong\u003e Experience Full Vibrance of Your Live Watch Face Always Activated On Your Wrist Resembling A Classic Watch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWrinkle Free Vegan Leather Strap:\u003c\/strong\u003e Industry’s First Luxury Smartwatch That’s Made For Activity With A Vegan Leather Strap That is Resistant to Wrinkles, Tears and is Sweat \u0026amp; Splash Proof\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e1.43” Ultra AMOLED Display:\u003c\/strong\u003e Immerse in the true vibrance of 600 NITS Brightness a 1.43” ULTRA AMOLED Display making every bezel beyond imagination\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Suite:\u003c\/strong\u003e Receive calls, texts, and social media alerts along with Stock Market Updates and choose from 100+ Workout Modes making the Crown your ultimate companion in luxury\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"specifications\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Crown Smart Watch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ultra AMOLED Display, 600 Nits Brightness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth Tracking:\u003c\/strong\u003e Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eActivity Tracking:\u003c\/strong\u003e Steps, calories, various exercise modes.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long-lasting, multi-day battery life on a single charge.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization:\u003c\/strong\u003e Multiple customizable watch faces.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"why-choose\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Crown Smart Watch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Crown isn’t just a choice, it’s a testament of luxury that’s built for those who don’t compromise on their lifestyle with a Chrome Plated Finish, an Ultra AMOLED Display and a smart screen that’s Always On to display your statement, the Crown empowers your wrist with features beyond belief. Moreover, the Crown with its wrinkle free Vegan Leather Strap and over a 100 Workout Modes, this \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eis your wrist’s companion for every walk of life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Brown Leather","offer_id":49454925873430,"sku":"22772","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Leather","offer_id":49454925840662,"sku":"22773","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Metal","offer_id":49454925807894,"sku":"20912","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Metal","offer_id":49454961754390,"sku":"20913","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/STRAP01.webp?v=1754740631"},{"product_id":"revoltt-pro-smartwatch","title":"Revoltt Pro Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eRevolttt Pro Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe revolttt Pro is a cutting-edge smartwatch designed to seamlessly blend health, connectivity, and style. Featuring a sleek AMOLED display, it provides crystal-clear visuals and exceptional battery life, allowing you to stay connected for up to 5 days with a single charge. Whether you're tracking your heart rate, monitoring your sleep, or controlling your music, the revoltt Pro brings modern tech to your wrist with a sporty design that suits every lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Revolttt Pro\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Revolttt Pro combines performance and style with an AMOLED display (1.43 inches, 466x466 resolution) for vibrant visuals and easy navigation across 8 menu styles. Equipped with Bluetooth 5.3, it offers seamless connectivity for calls, messaging alerts, and synchronization with your phone’s contact list.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003esmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003efeatures multiple health monitoring functions, including heart rate, blood pressure, SP02, sleep monitoring, and more, ensuring you stay on top of your health at all times. The built-in Google and Siri Voice Assistants offer added convenience, while the diverse sports modes and the ability to control music directly from the watch make it perfect for both fitness and entertainment enthusiasts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a water resistance rating of IP67, a durable metal and plastic body, and a stainless steel strap, the Revoltt Pro is both stylish and functional. Plus, with up to 5 days of battery life, you can keep up with your busy schedule without constant recharging.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Revoltt Pro\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 1.43 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: AMOLED\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResolution: 466 x 466\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Version: 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Calling Chip: Single chip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTransmission Range: 10 meters\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSynchronize Contact Book\/Calls: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncoming Call\/Messaging Alert: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSensors\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate: HX3605\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePedometer: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Pressure Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSP02 Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOxygen Monitor: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Consumption: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking (female): Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathing Training: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharge Time: 150 minutes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWorking Time: 5 days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStandby Time: 480 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Type: 671927\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Method: 2-pins magnet cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePhysical Specifications\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 55.00*49.00*14.00 mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBody Material: Metal + Plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStrap Material: Stainless Steel\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight: 66g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance: IP67\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Features\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWatch Faces: 100+ Cloud, 5+1 Built-in, Animated Support\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSports Modes: 5 Cloud, 107 Built-in\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLanguages: 12+ (including English, Spanish, French, Arabic, etc.)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGames: 4 (Flappy Bird, 2048, Whack-A-Mole, Thunder Fighter)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoice Assistants: Google, Siri\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMusic Control: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCamera Control: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeather Updates: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOther Features: Alarm, Flash Light, Calculator, DND Mode, Pedometer, Sedentary Reminder, Water Reminder\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Revoltt Pro\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Revoltt Pro is your ultimate wrist companion for fitness, productivity, and entertainment. Its stylish, durable design, along with robust health tracking capabilities and seamless connectivity, makes it the ideal choice for those who demand the best in wearable tech. Whether you're at the gym, in a meeting, or on the go, the Revoltt Pro keeps you connected, healthy, and in control.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gun Metal","offer_id":49534031266070,"sku":"22409","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":49534031200534,"sku":"22411","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Champagne Gold","offer_id":49534031167766,"sku":"22407","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":49534031233302,"sku":"22805","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/02_14d4c7f7-c21c-49be-8519-5f340b58ebd5.webp?v=1734007033"},{"product_id":"icon-smartwatch","title":"Icon Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eIcon Smartwatch Overview\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Icon Smartwatch combines advanced technology with a sleek design, offering a premium wearable experience. Equipped with a 1.38-inch TFT HD display, this smartwatch provides clear visuals and easy navigation. It features a range of health tracking capabilities such as dynamic heart rate monitoring, SpO2 measurement, and sleep tracking, helping you maintain your fitness goals. With an impressive battery life and a variety of smart features like quick dial pad, camera control, and smart notifications, the Icon Smartwatch is the perfect blend of functionality and style for tech enthusiasts and fitness lovers alike.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Icon Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStylish design with a 1.38-inch TFT HD display.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExtensive health monitoring features, including dynamic heart rate, SpO2, sleep tracking, and more.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOffers customizable watch faces with 4 built-in options and 100+ cloud-based watch faces.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSupports multiple sports modes for an active lifestyle.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdvanced \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003esmart watches\u003c\/a\u003e features like quick dial pad, camera control, smart notifications, and more.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Icon Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisplay Size: 1.38 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eScreen Type: TFT HD Display\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenu View Styles: 2\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Version: 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSingle Chip BT Calling\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Life: 7 Days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePhysical Specifications:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShape: Square\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance Rating: IP68\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRadiant Brightness\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHealth Monitoring Features:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDynamic Heart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFemale Health Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSmart Features:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWatch Faces: 4 Built-in, 100+ Cloud-based\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSports Modes: 100+\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuick Dial Pad\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmart Notifications\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlarm, Timer, Stopwatch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCamera Control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Icon Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eComprehensive Health Monitoring:\u003c\/strong\u003e Keep track of essential health metrics such as heart rate, SpO2, and sleep, ensuring that you stay informed about your well-being.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Connectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Stay connected with features like quick dial pad, camera control, and smart notifications right from your wrist.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDurable \u0026amp; Stylish:\u003c\/strong\u003e Featuring a sleek design and water resistance rating of IP68, the Icon Smartwatch combines style with robustness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":49669428314390,"sku":"22851","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Rose Pink","offer_id":49669428379926,"sku":"22853","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Space Blue","offer_id":49669428347158,"sku":"22852","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Red Berry","offer_id":49669428412694,"sku":"22856","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Grey","offer_id":49669428445462,"sku":"22877","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/b1.webp?v=1755342500"},{"product_id":"regal-smartwatch","title":"Regal AI Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Regal Smartwatch is an elegant fusion of style and innovation. Its sleek, modern design and durable construction make it a versatile accessory for any occasion, whether you're at work, out casually, or hitting the gym.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStylish and Durable Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Sleek, modern finish with sturdy construction.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVivid AMOLED Display:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.19-inch screen with customizable menu views.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong-Lasting Battery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–7 days of regular use and up to 25–30 days on standby. Quick 2-hour charging.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking:\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Level Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStress Management Tools\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e107 Sports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tracks performance across various activities including running, cycling, and yoga.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStay Connected:\u003c\/strong\u003e Handle calls, messages, and notifications from your wrist.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant Compatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e Interact with Google Assistant or Siri.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt-In Entertainment:\u003c\/strong\u003e Includes 4 fun games like Flappy Bird and 2048.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEveryday Tools:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alarms, weather updates, flashlight, and calculator.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.19-inch AMOLED screen.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–7 days of regular use, 25–30 days on standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e Heart rate monitor, blood pressure tracker, SpO2 level measurement, sleep tracking, stress management, menstrual cycle tracking.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e 107 modes including running, cycling, yoga.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Calls, messages, notifications, music playback, call records, find phone.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Google Assistant, Siri.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGames:\u003c\/strong\u003e 4 built-in games.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAdditional Tools:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alarms, weather updates, flashlight, calculator.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Regal Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Regal \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eis the perfect blend of sophistication and smart innovation. With its stylish design, comprehensive health tracking features, and a suite of practical and entertainment tools, it seamlessly fits into your daily life. Whether you're focused on fitness, staying organized, or just having some fun, the Regal Smartwatch is your ideal companion, ready to step into the future with you!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Copper Silver","offer_id":50270222516502,"sku":"22552","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Obsidian Gold","offer_id":50372312826134,"sku":"22554","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Rose Gold","offer_id":49685919531286,"sku":"22550","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Aqua Silver","offer_id":49685919465750,"sku":"22556","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Emerald Silver","offer_id":49685919432982,"sku":"22558","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Racing Red Silver","offer_id":49685919498518,"sku":"22548","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/CopperSilver_1.webp?v=1756127463"},{"product_id":"edge-smartwatch","title":"Edge Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eThe Edge Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStylish and Durable Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Lightweight construction (22g) with a sturdy PC+ABS finish.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVivid TFT Display:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.83-inch screen with a resolution of 240×284 pixels.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong-Lasting Battery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 7–9 days of regular use and up to 35 days on standby. Quick charging in under 2.5 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Level Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathe Training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStress Management Tools\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Burned Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eStay Connected\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManage calls, messages, and notifications directly from your wrist.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCamera Control for snapping moments.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\"Find Phone\" feature for convenience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eEveryday Tools\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlarms, weather updates, flashlight, calculator, and motion gesture for screen activation.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSedentary, drink water, and hand wash reminders.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.83-inch TFT screen with 240×284 resolution.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 7–9 days regular use, 35 days on standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Less than 2.5 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68 rating for durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOperating System:\u003c\/strong\u003e Compatible with Android 9+ and iOS 12+.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3 with 10-meter transmission range.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Edge Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Edge \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003edelivers a harmonious blend of functionality and style. With advanced health tracking, seamless connectivity, and practical everyday tools, it fits right into your lifestyle. Whether you're working, exercising, or relaxing, the Edge Smartwatch enhances every moment with its innovative features and long-lasting performance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":49894865142038,"sku":"22878","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":49894865174806,"sku":"22879","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gray","offer_id":49894865109270,"sku":"22943","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Rose Pink","offer_id":49894865240342,"sku":"22945","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red Berry","offer_id":49894865207574,"sku":"22944","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/B1_218495a9-8f36-4abf-b51a-64671c0db56e.webp?v=1767865748"},{"product_id":"jewel-smartwatch","title":"Jewel Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eJewel Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eStylish and Durable Design\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExquisitely engineered with a robust Zinc alloy shell combined with PC and ABS elements. Available in two variants—Jewel (with a lightweight profile of 30g\/44g strap options) and Jewel SE (83g with a premium steel band)—this smartwatch is built to complement your style without weighing you down.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eVivid AMOLED Display\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnjoy a 1.1-inch AMOLED screen with a crisp 360×360 resolution that delivers vibrant visuals and excellent clarity for day-to-day interactions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eReliable Battery Performance\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePowered by a polymer battery (230mAh), the Jewel \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eoffers 5–7 days of active use alongside up to 20 days on standby. A swift charge in just 2 hours gets you back on track without missing a beat.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Pressure Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathe Training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Consumption Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eStay Connected\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEffortlessly manage calls, notifications, and alerts directly from your wrist. With seamless contact synchronization, call records, and split-screen functionalities, the Jewel Smartwatch ensures you never miss an important moment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eEveryday Tools\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustomize your experience using over 300 cloud-based watch faces—with 5 built-in options and DIY support—and choose from 110+ sports modes (8 built-in). Additional smart tools include voice assistant support through Google Assistant and Siri, camera control for capturing life’s moments, weather updates, alarms, calculator, LCD brightness adjustments, theater\/DND mode, motion gesture activation, and essential reminders for sedentary behavior and hydration.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisplay: 1.1-inch AMOLED screen with 360×360 resolution.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Life: 5–7 days of active use, 20 days on standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Time: 2 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance: IP67 rating for dependable durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperating System: Compatible with Android 5.0+ and iOS 10+ (supporting Bluetooth 4.0).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Version: BLE 5.0 with a 10-meter transmission range.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Jewel Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Jewel Smartwatch offers an extraordinary blend of aesthetics, functionality, and smart connectivity. Whether you choose the classic Jewel or the premium Jewel SE, its refined design, comprehensive health tracking, and plethora of everyday tools ensure that you remain connected and in control—no matter if you’re working out, working hard, or winding down at the end of the day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Golden Milannese","offer_id":49924661870870,"sku":"22900","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gold Metal","offer_id":49924662001942,"sku":"22902","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Metal","offer_id":49924662034710,"sku":"22910","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pink Leather","offer_id":49924661936406,"sku":"22906","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pearl White Leather","offer_id":49924661903638,"sku":"22904","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Milannese","offer_id":49924662067478,"sku":"22908","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Milannese","offer_id":49924661838102,"sku":"22896","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Metal","offer_id":49924661969174,"sku":"22898","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Jewel_1_57b8f293-03c2-46be-9f76-79cf4af38c09.webp?v=1773449006"},{"product_id":"orbit-2","title":"Orbit 2 Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch3 data-end=\"159\" data-start=\"117\"\u003eOrbit 2 Smartwatch by Zero Lifestyle\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"187\" data-start=\"161\"\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"361\" data-start=\"189\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"217\" data-start=\"189\"\u003eSleek and Durable Design\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"220\" data-start=\"217\"\u003eThe Orbit 2 Smartwatch is crafted to match both style and function, featuring a 1.38-inch round TFT screen with a sharp 240×240 resolution.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"705\" data-start=\"362\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"495\" data-start=\"362\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"495\" data-start=\"364\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"382\" data-start=\"364\"\u003ePremium Build:\u003c\/strong\u003e Zinc alloy middle frame, PC plastic bottom case, and anti-static silicone strap ensure durability and comfort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"577\" data-start=\"496\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"577\" data-start=\"498\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"521\" data-start=\"498\"\u003eCompact Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e Designed for a perfect wrist fit without adding bulk.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"705\" data-start=\"578\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"705\" data-start=\"580\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"606\" data-start=\"580\"\u003eIP68 Water Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Withstands daily splashes, sweat, and rain, making it ideal for workouts and outdoor adventures.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"820\" data-start=\"712\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"753\" data-start=\"712\"\u003ePowerful Battery \u0026amp; Efficient Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"756\" data-start=\"753\"\u003eStay powered through busy days with a reliable battery system.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1063\" data-start=\"821\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"821\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"823\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"840\" data-start=\"823\"\u003eExtended Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–7 days of working time and up to 15 days on standby.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"898\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"900\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"919\" data-start=\"900\"\u003eQuick Recharge:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully charges in just 2.5–3 hours.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1063\" data-start=\"957\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1063\" data-start=\"959\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"980\" data-start=\"959\"\u003eReliable Battery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 220mAh polymer battery with Seiko board protection for long-lasting performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1182\" data-start=\"1070\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1070\"\u003eSeamless Wireless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"1107\" data-start=\"1104\"\u003eEnjoy smooth pairing and stable connections for all your smart functions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1183\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1183\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1185\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1214\" data-start=\"1185\"\u003eLatest Bluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e Equipped with BLE 5.3 for fast, reliable transmission.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1335\" data-start=\"1272\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1335\" data-start=\"1274\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1293\" data-start=\"1274\"\u003eGenerous Range:\u003c\/strong\u003e Maintains connectivity up to 10 meters.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1336\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1338\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1362\" data-start=\"1338\"\u003eSmart Notifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e Stay on top of calls, messages, and app alerts directly on your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1551\" data-start=\"1442\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1480\" data-start=\"1442\"\u003eAdvanced Health \u0026amp; Fitness Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"1483\" data-start=\"1480\"\u003eTake charge of your health with comprehensive monitoring features.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1956\" data-start=\"1552\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1595\" data-start=\"1552\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1595\" data-start=\"1554\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1593\" data-start=\"1554\"\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring (LC09 Sensor)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1649\" data-start=\"1596\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1649\" data-start=\"1598\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1647\" data-start=\"1598\"\u003eBlood Oxygen (SpO₂) \u0026amp; Blood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1688\" data-start=\"1650\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1688\" data-start=\"1652\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1686\" data-start=\"1652\"\u003eSleep Monitoring (22:00–08:00)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1730\" data-start=\"1689\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1730\" data-start=\"1691\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1728\" data-start=\"1691\"\u003eBreath Training \u0026amp; Stress Function\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1791\" data-start=\"1731\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1791\" data-start=\"1733\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1789\" data-start=\"1733\"\u003ePedometer, Calories, Sedentary \u0026amp; Hydration Reminders\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1872\" data-start=\"1792\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1872\" data-start=\"1794\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1813\" data-start=\"1794\"\u003e8 Sports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Including walking, running, cycling, swimming, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1956\" data-start=\"1873\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1956\" data-start=\"1875\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1899\" data-start=\"1875\"\u003eGPS Motion Tracking:\u003c\/strong\u003e Via connected mobile app for precise activity mapping.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2054\" data-start=\"1963\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1997\" data-start=\"1963\"\u003eSmart Controls \u0026amp; Customization\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"2000\" data-start=\"1997\"\u003ePacked with features that make everyday life easier.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2419\" data-start=\"2055\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2105\" data-start=\"2055\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2105\" data-start=\"2057\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2103\" data-start=\"2057\"\u003eBluetooth Phone Calls \u0026amp; AI Voice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2136\" data-start=\"2106\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2136\" data-start=\"2108\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2134\" data-start=\"2108\"\u003eCamera \u0026amp; Music Control\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2183\" data-start=\"2137\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2183\" data-start=\"2139\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2181\" data-start=\"2139\"\u003eWeather Forecast (Today + Next 6 Days)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2244\" data-start=\"2184\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2244\" data-start=\"2186\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2205\" data-start=\"2186\"\u003eDIY Watch Face:\u003c\/strong\u003e Customize with your favorite photos.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2305\" data-start=\"2245\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2305\" data-start=\"2247\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2303\" data-start=\"2247\"\u003eStopwatch, Countdown Timer, Calculator, Split Screen\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2392\" data-start=\"2306\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2392\" data-start=\"2308\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2335\" data-start=\"2308\"\u003eMulti-Language Support:\u003c\/strong\u003e Including Arabic, German, Japanese, Chinese, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2419\" data-start=\"2393\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2419\" data-start=\"2395\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2417\" data-start=\"2395\"\u003eFun Gaming Feature\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"2458\" data-start=\"2426\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2671\" data-start=\"2459\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2505\" data-start=\"2459\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2505\" data-start=\"2461\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2473\" data-start=\"2461\"\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.38\" TFT, 240×240 resolution\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2545\" data-start=\"2506\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2545\" data-start=\"2508\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2520\" data-start=\"2508\"\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 220mAh polymer battery\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2580\" data-start=\"2546\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2580\" data-start=\"2548\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2566\" data-start=\"2548\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2.5–3 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=